Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Pusa-malu fou: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault natia: message ki: key.
>> decrypted := vault faaali: encrypted ki: key.

Tuuina-atu 
tusi: ['Message:'], laina-fou
tusi: message, laina-fou
tusi: ['Decrypted:'], laina-fou
tusi: decrypted, laina-fou.
